 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Five percent was normal once.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.92,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "But a yield is a weight, not a number, and the bridge under it is four times heavier.",
   "start": 2.56,
   "end": 7.08,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Every price you own is divided by that number.",
   "start": 7.86,
   "end": 10.22,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Start with the number.",
   "start": 11.06,
   "end": 11.92,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Two weeks ago the ten-year paid four point six six.",
   "start": 12.24,
   "end": 15.08,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "By Tuesday it paid four point eight three, the highest since October twenty twenty-three.",
   "start": 16.36,
   "end": 21.2,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Now put that number on the bridge it actually sits on.",
   "start": 22.0,
   "end": 24.54,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "In nineteen eighty-one, the federal load was thirty-one percent of GDP.",
   "start": 25.14,
   "end": 29.42,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Today that same load carries one hundred twenty-three percent.",
   "start": 30.32,
   "end": 33.62,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "And the load sends a bill.",
   "start": 34.06,
   "end": 35.34,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Federal interest runs one point two trillion dollars a year.",
   "start": 35.34,
   "end": 38.32,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "The thirty-year carries five point two eight, and every new bond is priced off that number.",
   "start": 38.96,
   "end": 43.66,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing defaulted.",
   "start": 44.52,
   "end": 45.42,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing crashed.",
   "start": 45.58,
   "end": 46.22,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "The load just went up.",
   "start": 46.44,
   "end": 47.44,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "So when someone calls five percent normal, ask them:",
   "start": 48.04,
   "end": 50.66,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "normal for which bridge.",
   "start": 51.24,
   "end": 52.12,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Nineteen eighty-one carried thirty-one percent.",
   "start": 52.12,
   "end": 54.86,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "This one carries one twenty-three.",
   "start": 54.86,
   "end": 56.34,
   "part": 1
  }
 ],
 "edit_pauses_applied": false
